'''Chinami Nishimura''' (Japanese: '''西村ちなみ''' ''Nishimura Chinami'') is a Japanese voice actress for {{aniseries|PTS}}.

==Biography==
Nishimura was born on November 18, 1970 in {{wp|Chiba Prefecture}}, {{wp|Japan}}. She has provided the voices for many {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} and [[Character of the day|characters of the day]] in {{aniseries|PTS}}. Her most notable role is all of the [[Officer Jenny]]s from [[Kanto]], the [[Orange Islands]], [[Johto]], [[Hoenn]], and [[Sinnoh]], before she passed the roles on to other voice actresses. Nishimura is currently affiliated with the talent agency {{wp|81 Produce}}.

